            "review_title": "Review at Số 4 Lý Đạo Thành",
            "review_text": "Inspire27787961571\n1 contribution\n0\nThe traditional donuts here are a must-try\nDec 2025 • Solo\nSeriously, they nail the texture. Super crispy and crunchy on the outside, then wonderfully soft and chewy inside. They tasted incredibly fresh, you can tell they were just made. The sweetness of the mung bean filling is spot-on, never too much. If you want a quick, authentic, and delicious street snack, stop here. I’ll definitely be back for more!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 13, 2025",
