            "review_text": "Companion12602568759\n2 contributions\n0\nI’ve just tried two savory fillings and both were really good.\nDec 2025 • Couples\nCrispy crust, generous filling. Normally, the soul of savory fried donuts is the dipping sauce, but here the donut itself is the star 🤣\nThe price is affordable, so I’ll definitely come back to support again\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 13, 2025",
